  "sourceText": "Garlic Onion Dip\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 2, 2009 - 11:57pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n8 ounces softened cream cheese\n2 tablespoons mayonnaise\n2 tablespoons milk\nDash cayenne\nDash lemon juice\nGarlic powder\nOnion powder\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients until smooth. Season dip with garlic and onion powder to taste. Chill. Serve with chips.",
